WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:03.097
Marion is seventy-one and has been planning

2
00:00:03.097 --> 00:00:05.047
her own funeral for months.

3
00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:08.064
Her memorial page is the part of that plan

4
00:00:08.064 --> 00:00:10.159
strangers will actually read.

5
00:00:12.656 --> 00:00:14.882
Start from my plan — her story,

6
00:00:14.882 --> 00:00:18.261
her photos and her song come across as they are.

7
00:00:18.262 --> 00:00:22.245
The page exists, and it already knows who it is about.

8
00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:26.013
Dozens of designs, and the one she picks is

9
00:00:26.013 --> 00:00:28.438
the one her family will recognise.

10
00:00:28.438 --> 00:00:31.311
Her name and her dates are already here,

11
00:00:31.311 --> 00:00:33.549
exactly as her plan holds them.

12
00:00:33.549 --> 00:00:37.757
The headline is the one thing only she could write.

13
00:00:38.937 --> 00:00:41.620
From here the page follows the plan —

14
00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.729
she edits once, in one place.

15
00:00:44.436 --> 00:00:47.646
The life story she wrote in her plan is here,

16
00:00:47.646 --> 00:00:49.799
as text she can still rewrite.

17
00:00:51.266 --> 00:00:54.222
The photo she filed under Memorial page is

18
00:00:54.222 --> 00:00:57.183
already on it, and still hers in the plan.

19
00:00:57.183 --> 00:00:59.841
And the song she chose for this page,

20
00:00:59.841 --> 00:01:02.299
not the one meant for the service.

21
00:01:05.215 --> 00:01:08.011
Published — and from here it is a link,

22
00:01:08.011 --> 00:01:10.391
not an app anyone has to install.

23
00:01:10.391 --> 00:01:12.546
This is what her family opens,

24
00:01:12.546 --> 00:01:15.494
her photograph over the design she chose.

25
00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:20.406
And her song, on the page she built while she

26
00:01:20.406 --> 00:01:21.300
still could.

27
00:01:23.574 --> 00:01:26.838
Tom lived across the street for thirty years.

28
00:01:26.838 --> 00:01:28.369
He was sent the link.

29
00:01:34.297 --> 00:01:37.364
His message is taken, and the page does not

30
00:01:37.364 --> 00:01:39.658
move. Nothing posts itself here.

31
00:01:42.707 --> 00:01:46.008
Back in Marion's plan, where Tom's message is

32
00:01:46.008 --> 00:01:47.186
waiting for her.

33
00:01:49.134 --> 00:01:51.360
Every tribute waits in a queue,

34
00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:54.236
whoever wrote it and however kind it is.

35
00:01:54.236 --> 00:01:57.284
She decides, one by one, what her page is

36
00:01:57.284 --> 00:01:58.406
going to carry.

37
00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.351
Accepted, and only now is Tom's message part

38
00:02:05.351 --> 00:02:06.248
of the page.
